---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Mahindra Mahalunge 3 BHK Signature | Premium Family Residences Near Hinjewadi"
  description="Mahindra Mahalunge 3 BHK Signature residences: 1,320 – 1,500 sq.ft.* carpet, 3 full bathrooms, family living, biophilic deck, and premium finishes at pre-launch pricing near Hinjewadi Pune."
  keywords="mahindra mahalunge 3 bhk signature, mahindra mahalunge 3 bhk large, 3 bhk family flats near hinjewadi, mahindra lifespaces mahalunge 3 bhk signature, 3 bhk premium mahalunge pune"
  canonical="https://mahindralifespaceshomes.in/residences/3-bhk-signature/"
>
  <section class="pt-32 pb-20 bg-charcoal-950 border-b border-white/10 relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-6">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3 py-1 rounded bg-gold-500/10 border border-gold-500/30 text-gold-400 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest">
        <span>Signature Configuration · Family Luxury</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold text-stone-100 max-w-4xl leading-tight">
        3 BHK Signature Residences: <br />
        <span class="gold-gradient-text">Generational Family Living at Its Finest</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-stone-300 text-sm sm:text-base max-w-2xl font-light leading-relaxed">
        Crafted for growing families and established IT leaders seeking expansive 3-bedroom configurations with 3 full bathrooms, a dedicated study, and panoramic biophilic deck in Mahindra's 13.46-acre sanctuary.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Specs -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-charcoal-900 border-b border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-6 text-center">
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gold-400">1,320 – 1,500 sq.ft.*</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Carpet Area Range</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-stone-100">3 Full Baths</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Including Master En-Suite</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gold-400">Vastu Compliant</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">North-East / East Facing</div>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 bg-charcoal-950 rounded-xl border border-white/10">
          <div class="font-serif text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-emerald-400">EOI Open</div>
          <div class="text-[11px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Pre-Launch Priority</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features + CTA -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-charcoal-950">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-10 items-start">
      <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl text-stone-100 font-bold">3 BHK Signature Floor Plan Highlights</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4 text-sm text-stone-300">
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-3"><span class="text-gold-400 font-bold">✦</span><span>Triple bedroom layout with separate master, guest, and children's rooms with full acoustic separation.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-3"><span class="text-gold-400 font-bold">✦</span><span>Master en-suite with dual vanity, large shower partition, and wardrobe alcove.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-3"><span class="text-gold-400 font-bold">✦</span><span>Integrated study/home-office zone adjacent to the living room for flexible WFH use.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-3"><span class="text-gold-400 font-bold">✦</span><span>Expansive 100 sq.ft.* panoramic deck with green reserve and Sahyadri hill views.</span></li>
          <li class="flex items-start space-x-3"><span class="text-gold-400 font-bold">✦</span><span>Zero dead-end corridors — every square foot converts into usable living space.</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 glass-card rounded-2xl border border-gold-500/30 p-8 space-y-6 text-center shadow-2xl">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-xl text-stone-50 font-bold">Unlock 3 BHK Signature Pricing</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-stone-300 font-light leading-relaxed">
          Request the confidential pre-launch cost sheet and detailed floor plan for 3 BHK Signature residences at Mahindra Mahalunge.
        </p>
        <button
          data-open-modal
          data-unit="3 BHK Signature"
          data-interest="3 BHK Signature Cost Sheet Request"
          class="btn-shimmer w-full py-3.5 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-r from-gold-300 via-gold-400 to-gold-500 text-charcoal-950 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs shadow-md hover:shadow-gold-500/30 transition-all cursor-pointer"
        >
          Get 3 BHK Signature Cost Sheet
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
